{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:58:45+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:58:45+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Siltronic AG","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"Germany","city":"Munich","website":"https://www.siltronic.com","employees":4210,"summary":"Siltronic AG, together with its subsidiaries, develops, produces, markets, and sells hyperpure silicon wafers for the semiconductor industry in Germany, Rest of Europe, the United States, Taiwan, Mainland China, South Korea, Rest of Asia, and internationally. The company offers polished and epitaxial wafers. It also provides Ultimate Silicon for use in CMOS technologies, such as DRAM and NAND components and memory chips; Float zone/FZ wafer based on float zone method; and HIREF wafers for discrete applications. Its products are used in electrical applications comprising computers, smartphones, industrial equipment, wind turbines, and cars with and without electric drives. The company was formerly known as Wacker Siltronic AG and changed its name to Siltronic AG in 2004. Siltronic AG was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Siltronic AG, avec ses filiales, développe, produit, commercialise et vend des plaquettes de silicium hyperpures pour l'industrie des semi-conducteurs en Allemagne, dans le reste de l'Europe, aux États-Unis, à Taïwan, en Chine continentale, en Corée du Sud, dans le reste de l'Asie et à l'international. La société propose des plaquettes polies et épitaxiales. Il fournit également Ultimate Silicon pour une utilisation dans les technologies CMOS, telles que les composants DRAM et NAND et les puces de mémoire; Zone flottante / FZ wafer basé sur la méthode de zone flottante; et les plaquettes HIREF pour des applications discrètes."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":19222